      "items": [
        {
          "type": "HTML",
          "html": "Ebbo Essop-Adam was a diminutive right-hand batsman and fast and athletic fielder who played one ODI for Zimbabwe against New Zealand in 1992-93. His career record was very ordinary, with only two fifties in nine matches. He was also a decent hockey player.<BR><B>Martin Williamson</B>"
        }
      ]
